WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.580
This one is about sound.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.062
Your video has captions,
and every word is right.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.337
But one long line flashing by is
not something anyone can read.

4
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.412
Accuracy was
the only thing anybody measured.

5
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.487
Here, captions follow
the rules of professional subtitling.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.680
2 lines at most, and time to read them.

7
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.320
It also tells who is speaking,
and translates the captions.

8
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.362
Everything runs on your machine.
No sound ever leaves it.

9
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.400
And it works backwards too:
it reads text aloud.

10
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.175
The voice comes with its own captions,
like this film.

11
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.760
Speech to text, text to speech.
One tool, both directions.

12
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

13
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
